          "short": "$n=120$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{3}{8}&=\\frac{3\\times15}{8\\times15}\\\\\\frac{3}{8}&=\\frac{45}{120}\\\\n&=120\\end{align*}$$",
